        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4-number" value="4" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0066FF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1780" y="730" width="40" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4-title" value="访问控制 Access Control" style="text;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1835" y="738" width="475" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4-items" value="1) API Key 管理&#xa;2) OAuth 2.0 认证&#xa;3) RBAC (角色权限)&#xa;4) 审计日志 (完整请求链)&#xa;5) Cost Tracking (成本监控)&#xa;6) 数据隔离 (多租户)" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;opacity=95;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1790" y="790" width="320" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-shadow" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E5E7EB;strokeColor=none;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="84" y="1024" width="2230" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#F8F9FF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1020" width="2230" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-title" value="安全开发实践 Secure Development" style="text;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0066FF;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1050" width="2100" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev1-title" value="红队测试 Red Teaming:" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1110" width="700" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev1-content" value="• 持续对抗性测试 (Jailbreak尝试)&#xa;• 自动化测试工具 (Garak, PyRIT)&#xa;• 奖励漏洞赏金计划" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1136" width="700" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev2-title" value="数据治理:" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="1110" width="700" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev2-content" value="• 训练数据审计 (内容合规)&#xa;• 用户输入脱敏 (不记录敏感数据)&#xa;• 数据保留策略 (GDPR合规)" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="1136" width="700" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev3-title" value="监控与响应:" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="1114" width="160" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev3-content" value="• 异常使用模式检测&#xa;• 成本异常告警 (Token爆增) &#xa;• 安全事件响应 Playbook &#xa;• 模型降级/隔离机制" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="1143" width="460" height="87" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="参考: OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025 | NIST AI Risk Management Framework | Microsoft Responsible AI Standard" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#9CA3AF;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
